What is it?
~~~~~~~~~~~
QmailAdmin is a cgi program for administering Qmail with vchkpw.

Requirements:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
- A UNIX computer (Linux/Solaris/BSD) and C compiler (gcc)

- A web server (Apache, Zeus)
    http://www.apache.org/

- Qmail
    http://cr.yp.to/qmail.html 
    https://notes.sagredo.eu/en/qmail-notes-185/upgrading-qmail-82.html

- vpopmail (a virtual domain addon for qmail) 
    https://notes.sagredo.eu/en/qmail-notes-185/installing-and-configuring-vpopmail-81.html

- ezmlm installed in /usr/local/bin/ezmlm 
    https://notes.sagredo.eu/en/qmail-notes-185/ezmlm-idx-96.html

- autorespond installed in /usr/local/bin/autorespond 
    https://notes.sagredo.eu/en/qmail-notes-185/autorespond-24.html

Updates?
~~~~~~~~
 Latest version is available at:

    https://notes.sagredo.eu/en/qmail-notes-185/qmailadmin-23.html

 Please refer your suggestions/bug reports to https://notes.sagredo.eu/en/qmail-notes-185/qmailadmin-23.html


